  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: No screw to be cleared
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Aucune vis \xE0 d\xE9visser"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Keine Schraube, die gel\xF6st werden muss"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Nessuna vite da pulire
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30AF\u30EA\u30A2\u3059\u308B\u30CD\u30B8\u306F\u3042\u308A\u307E\u305B\u3093"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB098\uC0AC\uB97C \uC81C\uAC70\uD560 \uD544\uC694\uAC00 \uC5C6\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Nenhum parafuso a ser limpo
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u041D\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0438\u043D\u0442\u0430, \u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B\u0439
      \u043D\u0443\u0436\u043D\u043E \u043E\u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0442\u044C"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "No hay ning\xFAn tornillo que limpiar"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
