  - Language: English
    Text: More levels coming soon!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Plus de niveaux \xE0 venir bient\xF4t!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Weitere Levels kommen bald!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u8FD1\u65E5\u4E2D\u306B\u3088\u308A\u591A\u304F\u306E\u30EC\u30D9\u30EB\u304C\u767B\u5834\u3057\u307E\u3059\uFF01"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Altri livelli in arrivo!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB354 \uB9CE\uC740 \uB808\uBCA8\uC774 \uACE7 \uB098\uC635\uB2C8\uB2E4!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Mais n\xEDveis em breve!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0421\u043A\u043E\u0440\u043E \u043D\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043F\u0438\u0442
      \u0431\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0448\u0435 \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0432\u043D\u0435\u0439!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "\xA1M\xE1s niveles pr\xF3ximamente!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
