  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Activate the <color=#FFF44E>Gold Pass</color> to unlock exclusive rewards!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Activez la passe d'or pour d\xE9bloquer des r\xE9compenses exclusives!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Aktivieren Sie den Gold Pass, um exklusive Belohnungen freizuschalten!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Attiva il pass oro per sbloccare i premi esclusivi!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30B4\u30FC\u30EB\u30C9\u30D1\u30B9\u3092\u30A2\u30AF\u30C6\u30A3\u30D6\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3001\u6392\u4ED6\u7684\u306A\u5831\u916C\u306E\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u89E3\u9664\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uACE8\uB4DC \uD328\uC2A4\uB97C \uD65C\uC131\uD654\uD558\uC5EC \uB3C5\uC810
      \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744 \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Ative o passe de ouro para desbloquear recompensas exclusivas!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0410\u043A\u0442\u0438\u0432\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u0437\u043E\u043B\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0439
      \u043F\u0430\u0441, \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
      \u044D\u043A\u0441\u043A\u043B\u044E\u0437\u0438\u0432\u043D\u044B\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044B!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "\xA1Active el Pase de oro para desbloquear recompensas exclusivas!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
