--- !u!114 &9146728100847787452
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2642894425884686056}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: This feature compensates users for failed payments. Please contact us via
      email if you have issues receiving rewards after payment.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Cette fonctionnalit\xE9 compense les paiements \xE9chou\xE9s. Contactez-nous
      par e-mail si vous n'avez pas re\xE7u vos r\xE9compenses."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Diese Funktion entsch\xE4digt bei fehlgeschlagenen Zahlungen. Kontaktieren
      Sie uns per E-Mail, wenn Sie Ihre Belohnungen nicht erhalten haben.\n"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: 'Questa funzione compensa gli utenti per pagamenti non riusciti. '
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u3053\u306E\u6A5F\u80FD\u306F\u652F\u6255\u3044\u5931\u6557\u306B\u5BFE\u3057\u3066\u88DC\u511F\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002\u5831\u916C\u304C\u53D7\u3051\u53D6\u308C\u306A\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306F\u3001\u30E1\u30FC\u30EB\u3067\u3054\u9023\u7D61\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uC774 \uAE30\uB2A5\uC740 \uACB0\uC81C \uC2E4\uD328\uC5D0 \uB300\uD574
      \uBCF4\uC0C1\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4. \uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744 \uBC1B\uC9C0 \uBABB\uD55C
      \uACBD\uC6B0 \uC774\uBA54\uC77C\uB85C \uC5F0\uB77D\uD574 \uC8FC\uC138\uC694."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Esse recurso compensa os usu\xE1rios por pagamentos com falha. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u042D\u0442\u0430 \u0444\u0443\u043D\u043A\u0446\u0438\u044F \u043A\u043E\u043C\u043F\u0435\u043D\u0441\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u0442
      \u043F\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0437\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044F\u043C
      \u043D\u0435\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u043D\u044B\u0435 \u043F\u043B\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0436\u0438. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Esta caracter\xEDstica compensa a los usuarios por pagos fallidos. "
    Object: {fileID: 0}
