  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Relax for a while before the next screw challenge.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "D\xE9tendez-vous pendant un certain temps avant le prochain d\xE9fi \xE0
      la vis."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Entspannen Sie sich eine Weile vor der n\xE4chsten Schraubenherausforderung."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Rilassati per un po 'prima della prossima sfida a vite.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u6B21\u306E\u30B9\u30AF\u30EA\u30E5\u30FC\u30C1\u30E3\u30EC\u30F3\u30B8\u306E\u524D\u306B\u3057\u3070\u3089\u304F\u30EA\u30E9\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB2E4\uC74C \uB098\uC0AC \uCC4C\uB9B0\uC9C0 \uC804\uC5D0 \uC7A0\uC2DC
      \uD734\uC2DD\uC744 \uCDE8\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Relaxe por um tempo antes do pr\xF3ximo desafio do parafuso."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0420\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043B\u0430\u0431\u044C\u0442\u0435\u0441\u044C
      \u043D\u0435\u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u043E\u0435 \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043C\u044F
      \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434 \u0441\u043B\u0435\u0434\u0443\u044E\u0449\u0435\u0439
      \u0432\u044B\u0437\u043E\u0432\u043E\u043C \u0432\u0438\u043D\u0442\u0430."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Rel\xE1jese por un tiempo antes del pr\xF3ximo desaf\xEDo de tornillo."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
