  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Pinch the screen to zoom in or out.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Pincez l'\xE9cran pour effectuer un zoom avant ou arri\xE8re."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Ziehen Sie den Bildschirm zusammen, um hinein- oder herauszuzoomen.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Pizzica lo schermo per ingrandire o rimpicciolire.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u753B\u9762\u3092\u30D4\u30F3\u30C1\u3057\u3066\u62E1\u5927\u307E\u305F\u306F\u7E2E\u5C0F\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uD654\uBA74\uC744 \uD540\uCE58\uD558\uC5EC \uD655\uB300\uD558\uAC70\uB098
      \uCD95\uC18C\uD569\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Aperte a tela para aumentar ou diminuir o zoom.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0421\u0432\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043F\u0430\u043B\u044C\u0446\u044B
