  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Unlock All Screw Boxes <color=#AF5936>Permanently</color>!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "D\xE9verrouillez en permanence toutes les bo\xEEtes \xE0 vis!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Schalte alle Schraubenkisten dauerhaft frei!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Sblocca tutte le scatole a vite in modo permanente!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30CD\u30B8\u30DC\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u306E\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u6C38\u4E45\u306B\u89E3\u9664\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uBAA8\uB4E0 \uB098\uC0AC \uC0C1\uC790\uB97C \uC601\uAD6C\uC801\uC73C\uB85C
      \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C\uD558\uC2ED\uC2DC\uC624!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Desbloqueie todas as caixas de parafusos permanentemente!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0420\u0430\u0437\u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0439\u0442\u0435
      \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0432\u0438\u043D\u0442\u043E\u0432\u044B\u0435 \u044F\u0449\u0438\u043A\u0438
      \u043D\u0430\u0432\u0441\u0435\u0433\u0434\u0430!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "\xA1Desbloquee todas las cajas de tornillo de forma permanente!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
