--- !u!114 &3565555478843264950
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7713222313756030727}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Your level is in progress. Would you like to continue or restart?
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: Votre niveau est en cours de progression. Souhaitez-vous continuer ou recommencer
      ?
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Ihr Level ist in Bearbeitung. M\xF6chten Sie fortfahren oder neu starten?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: "Il tuo livello \xE8 in corso di aggiornamento. Vuoi continuare o ricominciare?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\u30EC\u30D9\u30EB\u306F\u9032\u884C\u4E2D\u3067\u3059\u3002\u7D9A\u3051\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3001\u305D\u308C\u3068\u3082\u518D\u958B\u3057\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF1F"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB2F9\uC2E0\uC758 \uB808\uBCA8\uC740 \uC9C4\uD589 \uC911\uC785\uB2C8\uB2E4.
      \uACC4\uC18D\uD558\uC2DC\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C, \uC544\uB2C8\uBA74 \uB2E4\uC2DC
      \uC2DC\uC791\uD558\uC2DC\uACA0\uC2B5\uB2C8\uAE4C?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "O seu n\xEDvel est\xE1 em progresso. Gostaria de continuar ou recome\xE7ar?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0412\u0430\u0448 \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0435\u043D\u044C \u0432 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0446\u0435\u0441\u0441\u0435.
      \u0425\u043E\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043F\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u0438\u0442\u044C
      \u0438\u043B\u0438 \u043D\u0430\u0447\u0430\u0442\u044C \u0437\u0430\u043D\u043E\u0432\u043E?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Tu nivel est\xE1 en progreso. \xBFTe gustar\xEDa continuar o reiniciar?"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
