  - Language: German
    Text: Schalten Sie alle Schraubenkisten frei!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Sblocca tutte le scatole a vite!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30B9\u30AF\u30EA\u30E5\u30FC\u30DC\u30C3\u30AF\u30B9\u306E\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u89E3\u9664\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uBAA8\uB4E0 \uB098\uC0AC \uC0C1\uC790 \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Desbloqueie todas as caixas de parafusos!
